  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E=\"></span>«<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{120}{8.0\\times 10^{-2}}=\"></span>»<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5\\times 10^{3}NC^{-1}\"></span> OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V m^{-1}\"></span> ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.i\"><p><strong>b.i</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F=\"></span>«<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"eE=\"></span>»<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.2\\times 10^{-19}\\times 1.5\\times 10^{3}\"></span> OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.8\\times 10^{-16}N\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a=\"></span>«<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F}{m}=\"></span>»<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4.8\\times 10^{-16}}{4\\times 1.67\\times 10^{-27}}\"></span> OR <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"7.2\\times 10^{10} ms^{-2}\"></span> ✓   Allow ECF from a). Award [1] if they use a charge of e and a mass of 2u obtaining the right result.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.ii\"><p><strong>b.ii</strong></p><p>ALT 1 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=\\sqrt{\\frac{2s}{a}}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=\"></span>«<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\times 8.0\\times 10^{-2}}{7.2\\times 10^{10}}}=\"></span>»<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5\\times 10^{-6} s\"></span> ✓   ALT 2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v=\\sqrt{2 a s}\"></span>«<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=1.06\\times 10^{5} ms^{-1}\"></span>» ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=\"></span>«<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{a}=\"></span>»<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5\\times 10^{-6} s\"></span> ✓   Award [2] if 1.5 x 10<sup>−6</sup>«s» is seen as the answer without working.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.iii\"><p><strong>b.iii</strong></p><p>240 eV ✓   Accept 3.8 x 10<sup>−17</sup> J</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>F<sub>m</sub> = F<sub>e</sub> OR qvB = qE OR B = F<sub>e</sub> / qv ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"B=\"></span>«<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E}{v}=\\frac{1.5\\times 10^{3}}{5.0\\times 10^{5}}=\"></span>»<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\\times 10^{-3}T\"></span> ✓   Award [2] if 3.0 x 10<sup>−3</sup> «T» is seen as the answer without working. Allow ECF from a) and b) i)</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>Horizontal / undeflected path ✓</p></section>"
